<title>AUSTRALIA: Wage decision good for jobs growth - Australia govt.</title>
<headline>Wage decision good for jobs growth - Australia govt.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Industrial Relations Minister Peter Reith said Tuesday's living wage outcome was positive for the jobs growth and the economy.</p>
<p>&quot;It's certainly positive for jobs growth and generally positive for the economy,&quot; Reith told reporters.</p>
</text>
